# Marketing Park (`marketing_park` / `kit_content`)

- Product package: **`marketing_park`**. Platform module: **`kit_content`**. Org/tenant: **`KIT_MKT`**.
- Independent park. Do **not** add Content migrations to `deploy/ubuntu/migration-files.prod.txt` (Pharmacy) or `migration-files.family-os.txt`.
- Apply via `deploy/ubuntu/migration-files.content.txt` only (281+ including `286_pack_content_marketing_park_tenant.sql`). Runner: `deploy/ubuntu/run-kit-migrations-content.sh` / `apply-kit-migrations-content.sh` — never `migration-files.prod.txt`.
- Do not couple Content services to Pharmacy sales/inventory tables or Family OS workers.
- Do not show Marketing nav on Novixa/Famixa tenants — gate with `platformModule: kit_content` + vertical `marketing`.
- Prefer **dynamic JSON catalogs** (connector types, channel types, variant kinds, image rates) over new ALTER TABLE for each brand/site/page.
- Budget ceilings are first-class settings; do not hardcode USD rates in C# beyond seeds.
- Expanding web/page = new `site_target` / `channel_target` rows, not a platform upgrade.
- Brands (KIT, Novixa, Famixa, Vân Đỉnh Trà) are **content brands inside KIT_MKT**, not product packages.
- Content Package (`pack_content.content_package`) = Core Idea (or a brand adaptation via `source_package_id`). Idea Pool: batch Brand Fit, operator confirms cells, then create adaptations. Tab «Gợi ý tiếp» đề xuất ý gốc mới từ catalog đã có — operator tick rồi thêm vào pool. Do not auto-fanout to all brands. Do not add a `ContentIdea` table.
- Video Factory (`pack_content.video_*`): từ Package kéo `tiktok_script` → storyboard local; Creatomate optional (`Content:CreatomateApiKey`). Không auto-post TikTok.
- Famixa Series pilot lives on **Videos → Series Famixa**. Pipeline: **khóa kịch bản** (tự dán **kịch bản tập** EP/SCENE/thoại — KIT parse bung graph **theo Scene container** (thoại/action thuộc đúng SC, không copy ngang, không nuốt instruction/debug, Shot ID unique theo tập; Nhận pack **replace** story graph, giữ Canon; duyệt Parsed Story trước khi khóa), không đòi `--- SHOT ---` / VIDEO ID master; **hoặc** AI đề xuất nháp vào cùng ô — operator sửa rồi Nhận pack; không tự khóa / không tự I2V; không tự viết thoại; khóa điền Action từ STORY pack + khóa Continuity từ graph) → vai + **Khóa Cast & Canon** (1 ảnh mặt/tóc + **Voice Canon ElevenLabs** / CHAR; dropdown chỉ **giọng miền Bắc** theo vai: Bố = phụ huynh nam, Mẹ = phụ huynh nữ, Minh = bé trai, CHAR mới = đúng loại; short/shot inherit, không picker từng clip; **không** gửi Canon crop vào I2V; **TTS nghe thử kịch bản** `POST /api/content/series/tts` ElevenLabs `eleven_v3` + `language_code=vi` theo CHAR (MP3 mặc định gói hiện tại — không ép `mp3_44100_192` vì cần Creator) — **không** `eleven_flash_v2_5` (rẻ/nhanh, giọng méo so với playground) và **không** `eleven_multilingual_v2` (không có tiếng Việt, đọc như Hindi); chưa mux vào video, không trừ Runway) → **short 9:16** (nếu pack có short thì khóa hết) → **dựng cảnh 16:9** (Memory + Action + KF cảnh + I2V; **Production Plan** NEW / REUSE_PREVIOUS / REUSE_SCENE_BASELINE trên graph sẵn có — không bảng mới; **Tạo KF toàn cảnh** chỉ Gemini shot NEW thiếu KF, REUSE copy pixel; Contact Sheet duyệt KF_CLEAN — không gửi lưới 12 ô vào I2V; **Đổi ảnh** = `kfForceNew`; continuity đổi chỗ = Accept KF mới / Giữ baseline, không tự viết Memory; **Tạo hết shot cảnh** chỉ shot KF đã duyệt + Action + Continuity, một confirm tổng cr, skip blocked, dừng khi gửi fail — QC / khóa shot / Final vẫn tay) → Timeline Final. Graph persist: localStorage + `PUT /api/content/series/pilot` blob `pack_content.series_pilot` (mig 313; **không** dataUrl; không bảng Episode/CHAR). Default paste box stays empty. Script draft: `POST /api/content/series/script-draft` (Gemini + **Famixa Brand Brain** `FormatForSeriesDraft`, 0 Runway cr). I2V prompt = graph compiler + **Video Context** slice (`FormatForVideoContext` — visual/forbidden, not 48 source docs). Distill strategy docs into Thương hiệu Famixa (operational brief + knowledge). Series I2V: Runway `gen4_turbo` or Fal Wan 2.1 (`engine=wan`) via `POST /api/content/series/turbo`. Scene/short KF may be Gemini-generated from Character Canon refs (`POST /api/content/series/still`) as a **full-scene still** — never send CHAR face-crop to I2V; operator duyệt KF rồi mới Turbo. Do not call Gen-4.5. No DeepSeek scene rewrite.
- Famixa Character Canon SoT: Master Reference v1.0 sheets in `client/admin/public/content/famixa/canon/` — CHAR-001 Minh, CHAR-002 Nam, CHAR-003 Linh. Hydrate on load + KF (IndexedDB cache). Do not lose faces to localStorage/server strip. Operator may replace; seed fills when pixels missing. Gemini stills use these as face/wardrobe refs, not as I2V input. Hierarchy: **Series → Series Arc → Season → Season Arc → Episode → Episode Narrative State → Scene → Shot**, plus **Character State/Arc** and **Relationship State**. Continuity is story + visual: what happened, who knows/believes/trusts, OPEN threads, promises, objects, consequences. KIT **tracks / inherits / warns**; Story Director writes. KIT must **not** invent resolution, apology, hug, lesson, redemption, or happy reset. OPEN threads stay OPEN until the Director or a later Story closes them. EP02+ inherits prior ledger/CHAR/relationship/threads; Director approves inheritance review before khóa kịch bản / I2V. No extra Orchestrator, RAG, or Episode/CHAR tables.
- Famixa **Full Voice** is an independent gate **before Image/I2V credit**: Story → Full Script (duyệt) → derived **Voice Script** (dialogue only; KIT extracts, operator does not rewrite screenplay) → Full Voice → Status COMPLETE → **Khóa Full Voice** → short/I2V. TTS `POST /api/content/series/tts` sends **one spoken CAST line per CHAR**. Never SC headings, action, SFX (`GÕ`/`CẠCH`), SMS/on-screen, recalled quotes (`Nhớ câu`), CUT TO, or packDraft dump. Parser **default-deny**: a line under a speaker slug is thoại only if `looksLikeSpokenLine` (third-person `Minh/Nam/Linh + verb` = action). INCOMPLETE (missing/truncated/out-of-order) blocks production. Same CHAR keeps the same Voice ID + settings. Regression: `content-famixa-voice-action.smoke.ts` + golden EP01 71 lines.
- Generate / publish / video MVP+render enqueue `pack_content.work_job`; `ContentWorkWorker` claims (SKIP LOCKED). HTTP returns Processing. Manual export remains the default publish path.
- Creative Brief (objective + format, optional emotion/visual/duration) lives in `content_package.extra_json`. Approve requires it. Do not add a Brief table.
- Quality gate **blocks** Approve (thin web, missing angle, fact without source, forbidden claims, missing Brief) and **blocks auto-publish** (same except Brief — already-approved packages can still ship). Group/caption nits stay advisory.
- `content_performance` = manual ingest (mig 311). No Meta Pixel / GA pull in this wave.
- Generate writes **only** variants implied by that brand's active `site_target` / `channel_target` rows (nơi đăng). Do not default-tick Website/Facebook/Video groups. No dests → refuse generate.
- V1 auto-publish **only**: `astro_git`, `wordpress_rest`, `facebook_page` (+ optional `manual` export). Instagram / LinkedIn / Buffer / groups / profiles = copy tay. Groups are never auto-posted.
- Facebook OAuth pending lives in `pack_content.facebook_oauth_pending` (mig 297) — not in-memory. Apply Content migs via `deploy/ubuntu/run-kit-migrations-content.sh` (reads `migration-files.content.txt`). Never merge into Pharmacy `run-kit-migrations-prod.sh`.
